vendor-patches/*/target
# The vendored libp2p-gossipsub patch deliberately does NOT commit its Cargo.lock.
# It is only used by `cargo test --manifest-path vendor-patches/libp2p-gossipsub-0.45.0/...`;
# the shipped build resolves this crate through the root lockfile. Committing it
# would add a fourth Dependabot-scanned manifest whose alerts describe nothing
# that ships -- exactly the noise the 2026-09-23 triage cleared out. See
# docs/plans/dependabot-triage-2026-09.md.
vendor-patches/libp2p-gossipsub-0.45.0/Cargo.lock
vendor-patches/libp2p-yamux-0.44.0/Cargo.lock
vendor-patches/relay_rpc-0.1.0/Cargo.lock

